# late-introduction (ABI-002, CuBit.Late_Introduction): late-intro-check
# starts first, without logstore (its optional request is Absent); procmgr
# introduces logstore to it when logstore starts. Its markers reach the
# serial console only through logstore's test mirror.
(startup v1
  (start "late-intro-check.app" (priority 5))
  (start "logstore.svc" (priority 5) (test-console approve-declared)))
